         <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Check when the input files have no MS1 spectra: MS1 deconvolution and feature detection are skipped, and each MS/MS spectrum is deconvoluted up to the maximum mass and charge, which are reported as its precursor mass and charge. Default: unchecked. (topfd -o, --missing-level-one)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
        </property>
